1. e4 e5 2. Nf3 d6 3. d4 Bg4 {Pins the knight, but the opening principle of quick development is Morphy's real weapon.} 4. dxe5 Bxf3 5. Qxf3 dxe5 6. Bc4 Nf6 7. Qb3 {Double attack on f7 and b7.} 7... Qe7 8. Nc3 c6 9. Bg5 {Pins the knight to the queen: every piece is joining the attack.} 9... b5? {Greedy; Black ignores development.} 10. Nxb5! {A sacrifice to rip open the queenside.} 10... cxb5 11. Bxb5+ Nbd7 12. O-O-O Rd8 13. Rxd7! {Removing the key defender.} 13... Rxd7 14. Rd1 Qe6 15. Bxd7+ Nxd7 16. Qb8+!! {The queen sacrifice that forces the finish.} 16... Nxb8 17. Rd8# 1-0
